{
  "id": "29790_suuryouka",
  "headword": "数量化",
  "reading": "すうりょうか",
  "romaji": "suuryouka",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, suru verb",
  "gloss": "quantification; expressing as numbers",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "quantification; expressing in numerical terms",
      "explanation": "The act of turning something qualitative or vague into measurable numbers so it can be compared or analyzed. Often used with する as a verb, especially in research and business."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "29790_suuryouka_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{効果|こうか}→効果：02726_kouka⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{数量化|すうりょうか}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧。",
      "english": "I quantify the effect.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "29790_suuryouka_ex2",
      "japanese": "{満足度|まんぞくど}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{数量化|すうりょうか}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{難|むずか}しい→難しい：00517_muzukashii⟧。",
      "english": "Quantifying satisfaction is difficult.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "29790_suuryouka_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{調査|ちょうさ}→調査：03489_chousa⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{結果|けっか}→結果：02486_kekka⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{数量化|すうりょうか}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ことで、⟦{変化|へんか}→変化：03615_henka⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{比較|ひかく}→比較：03576_hikaku⟧しやすく⟦なる→なる：01970_naru⟧。",
      "english": "By quantifying the survey results, changes become easier to compare.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Formed from ⟦{数量|すうりょう}→数量：05473_suuryou⟧ (quantity) + the suffix ⟦{化|か}→〜化：28335_ka⟧ (-ization). Takes ⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ to form a verb: {数量化|すうりょうか}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to quantify).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {数量化|すうりょうか}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to quantify\n- {数量化|すうりょうか}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{難|むずか}しい→難しい：00517_muzukashii⟧: hard to quantify\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{定量化|ていりょうか}→定量化：22613_teiryouka⟧: quantification — near-synonym, more common in scientific writing.\n- ⟦{数値化|すうちか}→数値化：16461_suuchika⟧: converting into numerical values — emphasizes assigning specific figures.",
